    "detailed_description": "No More Fathers is an adventure about a boys journey, exploring, flying, puzzle solving, helping others, and finding the truth<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/4b5d8c222473ece11f9a2b6f63a2155f.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/4b5d8c222473ece11f9a2b6f63a2155f.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/4b5d8c222473ece11f9a2b6f63a2155f.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fly</h2></strong> <br>Learn new skills and songs on your flute, flying through the world as a young boy who's best friend is The Wind!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/af3f0e75dbe63340c40c5167c2b0896a.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/af3f0e75dbe63340c40c5167c2b0896a.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/af3f0e75dbe63340c40c5167c2b0896a.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help Others</h2></strong> <br>Learn the truth about the past of the islands... and yourself<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/11ab50e58eec22865d59cc1a36404cc5.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/11ab50e58eec22865d59cc1a36404cc5.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/11ab50e58eec22865d59cc1a36404cc5.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and Solve</h2></strong> <br>Visit corrupted forests and islands lost to darkness, while <strong>solving</strong> puzzles to help restore The Wind and life to the islands<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/e0f838b9124ad83e6b8e34d2a5d3bad0.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/e0f838b9124ad83e6b8e34d2a5d3bad0.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/e0f838b9124ad83e6b8e34d2a5d3bad0.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Follow the mysterious and ancient wind, find yourself tangled in an enchanted journey to find the truth about your father that will lead to healing from your past and a new reality that will bring change to yourself and the islands that inhabit the sky, whether some villages agree with it or not.",
    "about_the_game": "No More Fathers is an adventure about a boys journey, exploring, flying, puzzle solving, helping others, and finding the truth<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/4b5d8c222473ece11f9a2b6f63a2155f.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/4b5d8c222473ece11f9a2b6f63a2155f.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/4b5d8c222473ece11f9a2b6f63a2155f.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fly</h2></strong> <br>Learn new skills and songs on your flute, flying through the world as a young boy who's best friend is The Wind!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/af3f0e75dbe63340c40c5167c2b0896a.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/af3f0e75dbe63340c40c5167c2b0896a.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/af3f0e75dbe63340c40c5167c2b0896a.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help Others</h2></strong> <br>Learn the truth about the past of the islands... and yourself<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/11ab50e58eec22865d59cc1a36404cc5.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/11ab50e58eec22865d59cc1a36404cc5.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/11ab50e58eec22865d59cc1a36404cc5.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and Solve</h2></strong> <br>Visit corrupted forests and islands lost to darkness, while <strong>solving</strong> puzzles to help restore The Wind and life to the islands<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/e0f838b9124ad83e6b8e34d2a5d3bad0.poster.avif?t=1738601190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/e0f838b9124ad83e6b8e34d2a5d3bad0.webm?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931410/extras/e0f838b9124ad83e6b8e34d2a5d3bad0.mp4?t=1738601190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Follow the mysterious and ancient wind, find yourself tangled in an enchanted journey to find the truth about your father that will lead to healing from your past and a new reality that will bring change to yourself and the islands that inhabit the sky, whether some villages agree with it or not.",
